# ============================================================
# IMPORTANT: DO NOT IGNORE THESE
# ============================================================

# EF Core migrations MUST be committed.
# Do NOT add:
#
# **/Migrations/
#
# Angular package-lock.json SHOULD be committed.
#
# Dockerfiles SHOULD be committed.
#
# docker-compose.yml SHOULD be committed.
#
# Helm charts SHOULD be committed.
#
# Kubernetes manifests SHOULD be committed.
#
# BPMN / DMN files SHOULD be committed.